{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"16443","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/16443","key":"MC-233276","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"28/Jul/21 6:16 AM","customfield_10050":"1098630","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>You can feed adult donkeys, horses or mules with maximum <tt>Temper</tt> value, and the hand animation is not played.</p>\n\n<p>The distinction of this issue from \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-93825\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-93825\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Client can always use food to reduce temper of horses, llamas and donkeys, ignoring animal's temper value\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-93825\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n is that it is NOT a desync, and it is not \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-236341\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-236341\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"You can feed hay bales to adult donkeys, horses or mules, but hand animation and animal eating animation/sounds are not played\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-236341\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n as it happens only with a high temper value, and all food exhibits this behavior. However, sometimes golden carrots do play animation and sounds on the first time.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Toreproduce\"></a>To reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Summon a donkey, horse, llama or mule with a <tt>Temper</tt> value of 100, e.g.\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/summon horse ~ ~ ~ {Temper:100}\n</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Give the animal any food.<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/help_16.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Very rarely, animations and sounds will be played one time.<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> No animations and sounds are played.</li>\n\t<li>Notice how the food is actually consumed, i.e. it is not a desync.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresult\"></a>Expected result</h3>\n<p>You should not be able to feed said animal; as per \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro\" data-jira-key=\"MC-201599\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-201599\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"When the horse, donkey, mule, llama &amp; trader llama no longer needs food, it will not make a neighs or angrily sound\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-201599\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-complete jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Open</span>\n            </span>\n, it should show the hand animation but the animal should not consume the food (this was the behavior in 1.15.2).</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Analysis%28tentative%29\"></a>Analysis (tentative)</h3>\n<p>Code analysis by <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=BugCrusherszz\" rel=\"noreferrer\">BugCrusherszz</a> can be found in <a href=\"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-236341?focusedId=1236962&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-1236962\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this comment</a>.</p>\n\n<p>I think that this is the piece of code that causes the issue, but I might be wrong.</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>net.minecraft.world.entity.animal.horse.AbstractHorse.java (Mojang mappings, 1.18-pre1)</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">...\n<span class=\"code-keyword\">protected</span> <span class=\"code-object\">boolean</span> handleEating(Player $$0, ItemStack $$1) {\n        <span class=\"code-object\">boolean</span> $$2 = <span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>;\n        ...\n        <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> ($$5 &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; ($$2 || !<span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.isTamed()) &amp;&amp; <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getTemper() &lt; <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.getMaxTemper()) {\n            $$2 = <span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>;\n            <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.level.isClientSide) {\n                <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.modifyTemper($$5);\n            }\n        }\n       <span class=\"code-keyword\">if</span> ($$2) {\n            <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.eating();\n            <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.gameEvent(GameEvent.EAT, <span class=\"code-keyword\">this</span>.eyeBlockPosition());\n        }\n       ...\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>If the animal's temper is equal or more than its max temper and it is not tamed, <tt>$$2</tt> is not set to <tt>true</tt>, so the game event and animations will not play. At least, this is what I understood.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/Sep/21 3:59 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/27940","id":"27940","filename":"2021-09-11 14-49-17.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bf89af0fdd92ce25290c17873c786fe?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FA-4.png"},"displayName":"ampolive","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"11/Sep/21 10:53 AM","size":"8.09 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/27940"}],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"09/Oct/23 6:32 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"27/Aug/26 2:41 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"You can feed adult donkeys, horses, llamas or mules with maximum Temper value, and hand animation is not played","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/a